flowchart LR
    A[Synthetic catalog cases] --> C{Validate fixtures}
    C -->|Schema, answer key, or split problem| D[Reject input]
    C -->|Valid| E[Select requested split]
    B[Handwritten example predictions] --> F{Check prediction IDs}
    E --> F
    F -->|Unexpected ID| D
    F -->|Valid IDs| G[Classify each expected case]
    G --> H[Report counts and per-case outcomes]
